# Gitignore for Apple Wallet signing certificates.
# These files are NEVER committed to the repository.
#
# Place your actual cert files here (mounted as /certs in Docker):
#   pass-cert.p12   – Apple Pass Type Certificate (exported from Keychain)
#   wwdr.pem        – Apple WWDR G4 root (download from developer.apple.com)
#
# This directory itself is tracked so the gitignore is committed; the cert
# files it contains are not.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
